        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player control again Terlander gangster in this 3rd person shooter game. Terlander mission is again to find money begs in different areas. World is full of  slow zombies and super zombies which are very fast. Also Soldiers and polices are enemies in different maps.  Player Terlander is gangster his only mission is to kill enemies and find money bags in 9 different areas. Player can find 2 different weapons pistol and rifle and can collect ammos to those weapons. Some levels include normal fast car so player can move faster, player can use fast car or just walk and kill enemies. Player can also kill enemies with car. So be the biggest robber in hole world and collect money bags. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different areas full of zombies and soldiers<br>- Try to find money bags to get rich<br>- 3 different ai opponents like zombies, super zombies and soldiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li></ul>",
